        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Zac attaches his arms to the ground and stretches back, launching himself forward.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Begin Charging:</span> Zac pulls himself taut, charging up a dash over 0.9/1/1.1/1.2/1.3 seconds.<br /><br /><span>Release:</span> Zac launches himself and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Up</span> enemies where he lands for up to 1 second (based on charge time), dealing them <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/105/150/195/240 + (80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Zac spawns an extra chunk of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Goo</span> for each enemy champion hit.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Can be cancelled by moving.<br />If cancelled, refunds half of the Ability's Cooldown and cost.</span>",
