      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "ZacR",
        "name": "Let's Bounce!",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Zac bounces four times, knocking up enemies hit and slowing them.",
        "bodyHtml": "Zac bounces 4 times. The first bounce to hit each enemy <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks</span> them back and deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(120/190/260 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Subsequent bounces deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/95/130 + (20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> by 20% for 1 second.<br /><br />Zac gains up to <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">50% Move Speed</span> over time and can cast <span>Unstable Matter</span> while bouncing.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Total Damage: <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(300/475/650 + (100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span><br /><span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">Move Speed</span> increases from <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">20%</span> to <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">50%</span> over the duration.<br />During Let's Bounce!, Zac is Ghosted. Ghosted units ignore collision with other units.</span>",
